        "hasImage": true,
        "elementIndex": 6
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 775.154750656168,
        "height": 76,
        "left": 104.88083989501311,
        "top": 55.85291338582677,
        "content": "O'sma turlari haqida",
        "fontSize": 66,
        "maxCharacters": 10,
        "elementIndex": 8
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 212.7649343832021,
        "height": 189.2450393700787,
        "left": 189.48797900262463,
        "top": 270,
        "content": "O'sma turlari - bu organizmning xujayralarining nazoratsiz ko'payishi natijasida yuzaga keladigan patologik o'smalar. Ular benign (yaxshi sifatli) yoki malign (yomon sifatli) bo'lishi mumkin. O'sma belgilari har xil bo'lishi mumkin, shu jumladan og'riq, shish, va boshqa noqulayliklar.",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "maxCharacters": 324,
        "elementIndex": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 212.7649343832021,
        "height": 25.343727034120732,
        "left": 189.48797900262463,
        "top": 213.39464566929132,
        "content": "O'smalarning belgilari",
        "fontSize": 15,
        "maxCharacters": 23,
        "elementIndex": 12
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "./images\\slide7_img74.png",
        "hasImage": true,
        "elementIndex": 13
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "./images\\slide7_img75.png",
        "hasImage": true,
        "elementIndex": 16
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 212.7649343832021,
        "height": 135.92010498687662,
        "left": 696.7748031496062,
        "top": 251.65238845144353,
        "content": "O'smalarni davolash usullari: jarrohlik, kimyoterapiya, radioterapiya. Har bir usul o'smaning turiga va rivojlanish bosqichiga qarab tanlanadi. O'smalarni erta aniqlash muhim ahamiyatga ega, chunki bu davolash samaradorligini oshiradi.",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "maxCharacters": 216,
        "elementIndex": 22
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 212.7649343832021,
        "height": 25.343727034120732,
        "left": 696.7748031496062,
        "top": 213.13270341207345,
        "content": "O'sma xujayralar",
        "fontSize": 15,
        "maxCharacters": 23,
        "elementIndex": 24
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "./images\\slide7_img76.png",
        "hasImage": true,
        "elementIndex": 25
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "./images\\slide7_img77.png",
        "hasImage": true,
        "elementIndex": 26
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 340.51685039370074,
        "height": 90.02866141732284,
        "left": 428.3793175853018,
        "top": 455.1692388451443,
        "content": "O'smalarni aniqlash uchun diagnostika usullari: ultratovush, rentgen, kompyuter tomografiyasi (KT) va magnit-rezonans tomografiyasi (MRT) qo'llaniladi. Bu usullar o'smaning joylashuvi va o'lchamini aniqlashga yordam beradi.",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "maxCharacters": 215,
        "elementIndex": 32
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 319.43160104986873,
        "height": 25.343727034120732,
        "left": 428.3793175853018,
        "top": 428.15443569553804,
        "content": "O'sma turlari: sarcoma, carcinoma, melanoma, glioma. Har bir o'sma turining o'ziga xos xususiyatlari va davolash usullari mavjud.",
        "fontSize": 15,
        "maxCharacters": 35,
        "elementIndex": 34
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "./images\\slide7_img78.png",
        "hasImage": true,
        "elementIndex": 35
      }
    ],
    "note": ""
  },
